<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower compared to Monday. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4	290-310 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows:  1.50-2.00 higher. Top 50.50.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-550 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	550-700 lbs    50.50</p>
</text>
